          shortDescription: "Strap in for the ultimate partnership challenge. Back Alley takes you through a grueling 25-hand campaign where hand sizes shrink and grow, and two 'Blooper' Jokers reign supreme. Coordinate with your partner, hit your targets, and avoid the devastating negative scores in this military-grade classic.",
